    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c99620bc532bc255b198c370",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一个是希望从地上扶摇直上；\n一个是希望从天上绽放光芒。两者虽不同──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd448f78384c0265c29d3d0517e380e3aab4c0c425ad64dd5a8dc38edbfb273a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a34ecf2684a83dd303e84e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心意却是一样的。\n同样期望以赛马娘的身份去为别人付出……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b3509e5999f81897e82fecdc79cdeccf32502ea20985c31d2cb06009e973d78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff1371b13c0b0ae3d9adcc28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你们两个都要加油喔",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bdf943538c32b2d2ac1cac9286d23195e1acc00874b83dd40819dc7a9ca3001",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
