    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45624b3ec4efde1b3f0c1986",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好，我们每年都会这样比赛嘛。\n今年年底还有“有马纪念”可以比，\n在那之前也比个什么吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba62854708eeb8928d14e1fe3f50c7231de67b2fecf636c6f4fde1b9363c85e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4eb60ca7874ef770e5ddc07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来每次新年都会找事情来比赛\n是她们两人的惯例。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a9635bfafc6c0cb55d021b55d6763d9dcdc7530ac8a27b797fc1752c38ee516",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
