      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小北，\n难得今天训练员也在，\n不如就让他来决定要比什么吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2711f6274ca525cca4ee7e230c17f22705c9d1719f971bf5db847ba9d74664d2",
